{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": ["messages"],
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsAppTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [ 0, 300 ],
      "id": "trigger-id",
      "name": "01 - WhatsApp Trigger",
      "webhookId": "c306ea26-8d81-4d6c-9446-ae927b95b153",
      "credentials": {
        "whatsAppTriggerApi": { "id": "TU_CREDENTIAL_ID", "name": "WhatsApp OAuth account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.messages[0].type }}",
              "operation": "equal",
              "value2": "location"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [ 200, 300 ],
      "id": "if-node-id",
      "name": "02 - Es ubicación?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const message = $input.first().json.messages[0];\n\nconst lat = message.location.latitude;\nconst lng = message.location.longitude;\nconst address = message.location.address || 'Ubicación directa de mapa';\nconst name = message.location.name || 'Punto GPS';\n\nconst mapUrl = `https://maps.google.com/?q=${lat},${lng}`;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    lat,\n    lng,\n    address,\n    name,\n    mapUrl,\n    userPhone: message.from\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [ 450, 100 ],
      "id": "code-node-id",
      "name": "03 - Procesar Coordenadas"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "insert",
        "tableId": "checkins",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "userPhone", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.userPhone }}" },
            { "fieldId": "lat", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.lat }}" },
            { "fieldId": "lng", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.lng }}" },
            { "fieldId": "address", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.address }}" },
            { "fieldId": "name", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.name }}" },
            { "fieldId": "mapUrl", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.mapUrl }}" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [ 650, 100 ],
      "id": "supabase-node-id",
      "name": "03B - Supabase: Guardar Check-in",
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "TU_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "TU_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $json.userPhone }}",
        "textBody": "={{ '✅ *Check-in Registrado Exitosamente*\\n\\n📍 *Lugar:* ' + $json.name + '\\n🗺️ *Dirección:* ' + $json.address + '\\n🔗 *Google Maps:* ' + $json.mapUrl }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [ 850, 100 ],
      "id": "send-location-ok",
      "name": "04 - Confirmar Check-in",
      "credentials": {
        "whatsAppApi": { "id": "TU_CREDENTIAL_ID", "name": "WhatsApp account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.messages[0].text.body }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Eres un asistente de IA útil para el Diplomado. Si el usuario pregunta cómo checar o registrar asistencia, indícale amablemente que debe enviarte su 'Ubicación actual' mediante Whatsapp (tocando el clip 📎 y luego Ubicación)."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [ 450, 400 ],
      "id": "9a724eac-479f-4eb7-9f81-adb7e997c8e9",
      "name": "05 - AI Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $json.messages[0].from }}"
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [ 550, 600 ],
      "id": "8eca272c-5a89-442f-8a7f-2fde7c3047a0",
      "name": "07 - Simple Memory"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [ 350, 600 ],
      "id": "0114f4c4-c3aa-4a42-8bb4-98873f63d03b",
      "name": "06 - Google Gemini Chat Model",
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": { "id": "TU_CREDENTIAL_ID", "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "TU_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $(\"01 - WhatsApp Trigger\").item.json.messages[0].from }}",
        "textBody": "={{ $json.output }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [ 750, 400 ],
      "id": "6465a9f5-16d4-4f9a-8002-6fc42a92c2a4",
      "name": "08 - Send AI Reply",
      "credentials": {
        "whatsAppApi": { "id": "TU_CREDENTIAL_ID", "name": "WhatsApp account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## [S7] WhatsApp Location Check-In & AI Agent\n\n1. Entra mensaje.\n2. **If**: ¿El mensaje es de tipo `location`?\n   - **TRUE**: Extrae Lat/Lng, CREA registro en Supabase y envía confirmación en WhatsApp.\n   - **FALSE**: Pasa al Agente de IA para responder dudas y pedirle que envíe ubicación.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 450
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [ 50, 50 ],
      "id": "sticky-note-2",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
